ike the stars in the sky and the sand on the seashore. Your descendants will possess the gates of their enemies.","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":9,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"he said, “Cursed be Canaan! A servant of servants shall he be to his brothers.”","from":2},{"book":"GEN","chapter":13,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But the land was unable to support both of them while they stayed together, for they had so many possessions that they were unable to coexist.","from":6},{"book":"GEN","chapter":13,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Lot chose the whole plain of the Jordan for himself and set out toward the east. And Abram and Lot parted company.","from":6}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3}]},"9-19":{"people":[{"id":"esau-h6215g","name":"Esau","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":9,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"eliphaz-h0464g","name":"Eliphaz","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Esau","count":5,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"adah-h5711h","name":"Adah","kind":"person","brief":"Daughter of Elon","count":3,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"mahalath-h4258g","name":"Mahalath","kind":"person","brief":"Esau's wife","count":3,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"reuel-h7467g","name":"Reuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Esau","count":3,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"a-wife-of-eliphaz-h0464i","name":"a wife of Eliphaz","kind":"person","brief":"Edomite woman","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"gatam-h1609","name":"Gatam","kind":"person","brief":"An Edomite","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"kenaz-h7073g","name":"Kenaz","kind":"person","brief":"An Edomite","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"omar-h0201","name":"Omar","kind":"person","brief":"An Edomite","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"teman-h8487g","name":"Teman","kind":"person","brief":"Grandson of Esau","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zepho-h6825","name":"Zepho","kind":"person","brief":"Grandson of Esau","count":2,"firstVer